    "$t": "台灣生態悲喜曲"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "周定邦<br />\n<br />\n<b id=\"internal-source-marker_0.195271173492074\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><i>1.玉山紅心柏白木林</i></span></b><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Tī斑芝kā天</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;織做白綿綿ê雲 了後</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Tī苦苓仔kā風</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;染做茄仔色ê海 了後</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">一聲雷 &nbsp;tân<span class=\"Apple-tab-span\" style=\"white-space: pre;\"> </span></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Hmh醒3952公尺kuân ê</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;Khut強</span><br />\n<a name='more'></a><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">紅心柏踏tī Bunun傳說ê胸坎</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">走揣天使ê目屎</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Sîn無雨水ê &nbsp;Ú-súi（雨水）</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">堅心khàng過一粒一粒刺心ê</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;火kho͘</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Suah hông lia̍p做一sian一sian</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;Lâm雪ê石膏尪仔</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">M̄願 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;kā目屎kǹg做一kuāⁿ</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;Mo͘h kah吐血ê</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;Luí志</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">規山坪（phiâⁿ） phuì kah lóng是</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;春天ê phoh</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">哀嘆ê puh-íⁿ聲</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Huân tī雪--裡</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Li̍h線tsuā ê khut強 tsiâu</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;Sui--去</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ǹg望 &nbsp;ǹg望</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Ǹg望ǹg望來lòng門</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Hō͘ guán一滴天使ê目屎</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Guán就beh亭亭</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Kā玉山 徛kah</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;青青青</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><i>2.七股內海</i></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Lò跤鳥仔 ná踏蹺（khiau）陣</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Kā跤插入地心一萬兩千里</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">一枝一枝kho͘做 </span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;青山港汕</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;網仔寮汕</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;頂頭額汕</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">烏肚鳥仔穿一su「天鵝湖」</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Tī水筆仔、海茄苳牽kah青ling-ling ê &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">網仔kuè--裡</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;跳</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;浪漫</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">掛放送頭ê耳仔</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">恬恬徛tī風--裡</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">聽 &nbsp;lā-pue講古</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">時速五十khí-lo͘h ê íng過</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">盤海過湧 &nbsp;八千里</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">像入銃籽ê掃射</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">淹崁台江3000年</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">古早古早</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Guán阿祖ê阿祖ê阿祖ê阿祖</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">白鴒鷥 &nbsp;暗光仔</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Bú-lōng千六甲烏khâm-khâm ê</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;驚惶</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Kiā目仔 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;kō͘秒速三米八ê</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Huah-hiu &nbsp;走去giú嚨喉鐘仔</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Khōng-khiang仔 &nbsp;kā翼股ut做</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;鑼 &nbsp;拍 &nbsp;鼓 &nbsp;挵</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Kin鰗鰡拍 蛇拳</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">海和尚 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;像tsǹg-ku̍t仔機</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Kā四五尺深ê大悲咒</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">夯kah一ìng一ìng</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">M̄知死ê tuā-kóng-sian</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">學烏旋風李逵 &nbsp;tī in ê跤tâng</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;舞 &nbsp;雙斧</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Lô͘-tsî tī徛棚仔頂</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Phi衫 &nbsp;欣賞一齣古nó͘-sū古ê</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;內海風雲</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">古早古早</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Guán阿祖ê阿祖ê阿祖ê阿祖</span><span style=\"color: blue; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: x-small;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span><br />\n<br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><i>3.南路鷹世紀傳奇</i></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">落山風tshuā guán一路落南</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">恆春半島leh叫--guán</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">翻頭</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">故鄉是pha-hng ê記持</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">五千外里長，十khí-lo͘h闊ê堅心</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Thn̂g種kap死亡</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Tī翼股 滾liòng</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">日頭酒醉 &nbsp;the tī紅霞ê胸坎</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">月娘沓沓仔徛tī kha-tsiah</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">借一phiàn相思林</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">目，喙，爪，翼</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Kō͘ 上飄撇ê khut勢</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">像流星歇tī恬靜ê天河</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">利劍劍ê目神</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">拆食 tō͘-tīng，蛤仔，夜pô</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Guán ê面是一首死亡</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">拆ha̍h，kā堅心絞做一káng</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;龍捲風</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Pha-kho͘ &nbsp;tshìng-kuân</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Tshìng-kuân &nbsp;pha-kho͘</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">紮規身軀 &nbsp;sa-bí-sí</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">飛</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">飛飛</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">飛飛飛飛</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">飛過茫茫ê大海</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">飛飛飛飛</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">飛飛</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">飛</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">飛到祖靈kho͘--guán ê所在</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Mâ年春分 &nbsp;guán ē轉--來</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">獵銃</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Guán beh用一支hō͘時間tiāⁿ--去ê爪</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">Kā am貪ê銃子</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> &nbsp;Sai還--恁</span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span><br />\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"color: blue; font-size: x-small; vertical-align: baseline;\">1. 玉山紅心柏：玉山圓柏。</span><br style=\"color: blue; font-family: 'LiHei Pro'; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\" /><span style=\"color: blue; font-size: x-small; vertical-align: baseline;\">2.Lò跤鳥仔：『高蹺鴴』。</span><br style=\"color: blue; font-family: 'LiHei Pro'; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\" /><span style=\"color: blue; font-size: x-small; vertical-align: baseline;\">3.烏肚鳥仔：『黑腹燕鷗』。</span><br style=\"color: blue; font-family: 'LiHei Pro'; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\" /><span style=\"color: blue; font-size: x-small; vertical-align: baseline;\">4.lā-pue：『黑面琵鷺』。</span><br style=\"color: blue; font-family: 'LiHei Pro'; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\" /><span style=\"color: blue; font-size: x-small; vertical-align: baseline;\">5.暗光仔：『夜鷺』。</span><br style=\"color: blue; font-family: 'LiHei Pro'; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\" /><span style=\"color: blue; font-size: x-small; vertical-align: baseline;\">6.kiā目仔：『角眼沙蟹』，koh號做「沙馬仔」。</span><br style=\"color: blue; font-family: 'LiHei Pro'; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\" /><span style=\"color: blue; font-size: x-small; vertical-align: baseline;\">7.khōng-khiang仔：『彈塗魚』。</span><br style=\"color: blue; font-family: 'LiHei Pro'; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\" /><span style=\"color: blue; font-size: x-small; vertical-align: baseline;\">8.海和尚：『和尚蟹』。</span><br style=\"color: blue; font-family: 'LiHei Pro'; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\" /><span style=\"color: blue; font-size: x-small; vertical-align: baseline;\">9.tsǹg-ku̍t仔機：鑽掘機。</span><br style=\"color: blue; font-family: 'LiHei Pro'; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\" /><span style=\"color: blue; font-size: x-small; vertical-align: baseline;\">10.tuā-kóng-sian：『招潮蟹』。</span><br style=\"color: blue; font-family: 'LiHei Pro'; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\" /><span style=\"color: blue; font-size: x-small; vertical-align: baseline;\">11.lô͘-tsî：『鸕鶿』。</span><br style=\"color: blue; font-family: 'LiHei Pro'; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\" /><span style=\"color: blue; font-size: x-small; vertical-align: baseline;\">12.徛棚仔：蚵架ê一種。</span><br style=\"color: blue; font-family: 'LiHei Pro'; font-size: small; white-space: normal;\" /><span style=\"color: blue; font-size: x-small; vertical-align: baseline;\">13.南路鷹：灰面鷲。</span></span><br />\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"vertical-align: baseline;\">（這篇是2011年阿却賞tio̍h獎作品）</span></span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: -webkit-auto;\">\n<span style=\"color: blue; font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: x-small; text-align: right; white-space: pre-wrap;\">                                                                                                     </span><span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: x-small; text-align: right; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> </span></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right;\">\n<span style=\"font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><span style=\"color: blue; font-size: x-small; vertical-align: baseline;\">\n\n\n</span></span></div>"
